        "title": {
          "en": "Claude Fable 5 Pricing Integrated Into AgentsView Tool",
          "zh": "Claude Fable 5 模型价格集成至 AgentsView 工具"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Simon Willison configured a custom price for the newly released Claude Fable 5 model within the AgentsView tool to track token usage.",
          "zh": "Simon Willison 在 AgentsView 工具中为新发布的 Claude Fable 5 模型配置了自定义价格，以追踪其令牌使用情况。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Claude Fable 5 was released today, requiring immediate pricing updates for usage tracking.",
            "AgentsView is a tool designed for monitoring token usage across various coding agents.",
            "The new model's pricing was manually added to AgentsView's database, as it was not included by default."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Claude Fable 5 于今日发布，需要立即更新价格以进行使用追踪。",
            "AgentsView 是一款用于监控不同编码代理的令牌使用情况的工具。",
            "新模型的定价被手动添加到 AgentsView 的价格数据库中，因为它最初未被包含。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This event highlights the ongoing need for tools to quickly adapt to new AI model releases for accurate usage monitoring and cost management, and demonstrates AI's utility in development tasks.",
          "zh": "此事件突显了工具需要快速适应新人工智能模型发布以实现准确使用监控和成本管理的持续需求，并展示了人工智能在开发任务中的实用性。"
        },
        "source": "Simon Willison",
        "link": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/9/agentsview-custom-model-price/#atom-everything"
      },
